1.13.0 Release notes (2026-09-x) // TODO: Update release date
================================

Improvements to the 'RingPublishingTracking' module.

### Changes

* Added IS (session identifier) field to every tracking event
* Extended RDLC field with variant.external custom parameters
* Added SQ (sequence) field to every tracking event
* 'segmentId' field of 'AureusEventContext' is now optional
    - passing nil omits the 'segment_id' key from the reported event instead of sending an empty value
* Added optional 'viewType' field to the 'RDLC' parameter, reported with page view event
    - new public 'ContentViewType' enum with 'text', 'tts' and 'smartshort' values
    - passed to 'reportContentPageView' and reported with that event only, it is not carried over to the events which follow it
    - events reported without a view type keep the 'RDLC' value they have today, which is the client alone
    - a parameter provided by an event is no longer overwritten by a decorator, so an event can extend a value otherwise shared by all events
* 'contentKeepAliveDataSource' parameter of 'reportContentPageView' is now optional
    - passing nil skips keep alive tracking for the reported content
    - the parameter has no default value, so a new call site has to make that decision explicitly
    - when keep alive tracking is skipped, measurement of the previously reported content is stopped
